# Control plane UI

Ops tool aesthetic: quiet, dense, readable. Not a marketing landing page.

## Typography

- One family only: **IBM Plex Sans**.
- Headings: weight 600, tracking ≈ `-0.01em`.
- No decorative page subtitles / eyebrows. Titles + actions only. Keep operational badges (status, version).

## Color & surface

- Flat backgrounds. No mesh/gradients/glow.
- Neutrals first; accent charcoal for actions.
- Borders: 1px `--border`.
- **Squircles**: `--radius: 12px` + `corner-shape: squircle` (class `squircle` / `.panel`). No sharp 4px boxes, no `rounded-full` pills.

## Components

- Buttons / inputs / badges / panels: `rounded-[var(--radius)]` + `squircle`.
- No page description blurbs under titles.
- Data lists use `DataToolbar` (search + filters + sort).
- Rule builder: left palette + right Scratch Dacă→Atunci C-block (`.rb-cblock`) with nested mouths. No dark full-page canvas.

## Layout

- Dashboard: dark sidebar (~240px) + light content.
- Sidebar IA by intent: **Magazin** (ops) → **Decizii** (rules/schema/themes/evals) → **Laborator** (test/diff/AI/audit); live store in footer.
- Prefer lists/tables over marketing grids.

## Do not

- Decorative subtitles that restate the feature.
- AI-default looks (purple glow, cream+serif, oversized display fonts).
